  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0042, merged in PR #4181): survey.json is confirmed as the canonical artifact name, with the concept renamed behavior map -> survey, the verb migrating to hypergumbo survey (run as deprecated alias for one minor version), and a loader alias list for legacy filenames. Stays violated until the implementing rename PRs land across CLI, code, tests, docs, and tracker; re-validate then."  # cbf6
